<div class="preheader">This week: three new trails and the autumn map.</div>
<div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;overflow:visible !important;height:auto !important;max-height:none !important;min-width:min-content !important">
<h1>Trail notes, week 46</h1>
<p style="overflow:visible !important;height:auto !important;max-height:none !important;min-width:min-content !important">Hello walkers, here is what changed on the hills this week. <a href="/inbox/mbx_test/18e7000000000000aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/links/0.l0o_LTcrYxLLspMS" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block !important;max-width:100% !important;overflow:hidden !important;color:#1a4fd6 !important;background-color:#fff !important;text-decoration:underline !important;font-size:max(1em, 12px) !important;line-height:normal !important;letter-spacing:normal !important;word-spacing:normal !important;text-indent:0 !important;vertical-align:baseline !important;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;min-width:0 !important;min-height:0 !important;max-height:none !important;margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;border:0 !important" target="_blank" title="https://trails.example/week-46">Read it on the web</a>.</p>
<div class="col"><img alt="The autumn map" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAASwAAADICAYAAABS39xVAAAACElEQVR4nAMAAAAAAUgGidIAAAAASUVORK5CYII=" style="float:right;margin:0 0 8px 8px" width="300"/><p>The <b>autumn map</b> is out, with the river path rerouted after the floods.</p></div>
<div class="col" style="overflow:visible !important;height:auto !important;max-height:none !important;min-width:min-content !important"><p style="overflow:visible !important;height:auto !important;max-height:none !important;min-width:min-content !important">Three new trails open on Saturday: <a href="/inbox/mbx_test/18e7000000000000aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/links/1.SFZw3ECgkGsuU05y" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block !important;max-width:100% !important;overflow:hidden !important;color:#1a4fd6 !important;background-color:#fff !important;text-decoration:underline !important;font-size:max(1em, 12px) !important;line-height:normal !important;letter-spacing:normal !important;word-spacing:normal !important;text-indent:0 !important;vertical-align:baseline !important;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;min-width:0 !important;min-height:0 !important;max-height:none !important;margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;border:0 !important" target="_blank" title="https://trails.example/t/ridge">Ridge</a>, <a href="/inbox/mbx_test/18e7000000000000aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/links/2.ffzO4AiELjtYCK0t" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block !important;max-width:100% !important;overflow:hidden !important;color:#1a4fd6 !important;background-color:#fff !important;text-decoration:underline !important;font-size:max(1em, 12px) !important;line-height:normal !important;letter-spacing:normal !important;word-spacing:normal !important;text-indent:0 !important;vertical-align:baseline !important;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;min-width:0 !important;min-height:0 !important;max-height:none !important;margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;border:0 !important" target="_blank" title="https://trails.example/t/mill">Mill</a> and <a href="/inbox/mbx_test/18e7000000000000aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/links/3.s7tV4A4Tn3y4QuOQ" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block !important;max-width:100% !important;overflow:hidden !important;color:#1a4fd6 !important;background-color:#fff !important;text-decoration:underline !important;font-size:max(1em, 12px) !important;line-height:normal !important;letter-spacing:normal !important;word-spacing:normal !important;text-indent:0 !important;vertical-align:baseline !important;width:auto !important;height:auto !important;min-width:0 !important;min-height:0 !important;max-height:none !important;margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;border:0 !important" target="_blank" title="https://trails.example/t/fen">Fen</a>.</p><p class="hide-mobile">Desktop readers: the printable PDF is on the site.</p></div>
